{
 "turn": {
  "user": {
   "zh": "按天统计最近 7 天的请求数与失败率。",
   "en": "Count requests and the failure rate per day for the last 7 days."
  },
  "status": "success",
  "rounds": 5,
  "calls": 4,
  "usage": {
   "input_tokens": 65635,
   "output_tokens": 1183,
   "total_tokens": 66818,
   "context_tokens": 16347
  },
  "prompt_version": "2026-10-08.11",
  "present": "ui",
  "parts": [
   {
    "type": "tool",
    "trace_id": "call_40d5d68c0fc024026fabd396bbd7220d"
   },
   {
    "type": "thought",
    "content": "**Verifying daily schema**\n\nThe aggregate returns a rolling trend rather than calendar days. I need to check the schema to see whether I can group the retained events by day myself, and decide how to label the partial first and last days of a rolling seven-day window."
   },
   {
    "type": "tool",
    "trace_id": "call_02441f75c1463e098881cc5d4b6053e6"
   },
   {
    "type": "thought",
    "content": "**Checking the window**\n\nThe window is the last seven days ending now, so it touches eight calendar days. I'll group `usage_events` by UTC date inside the same bounds the aggregate used, so the two results can be compared."
   },
   {
    "type": "tool",
    "trace_id": "call_122a49ef22bc7626687476829ba37d32"
   },
   {
    "type": "thought",
    "content": "**Checking SQL sums**\n\nAdding the daily counts: 96 + 214 = 310, plus 187 gives 497, adding 243 reaches 740, continuing with 268 gives 1,008, then 231 makes 1,239, 252 results in 1,491, and 141 brings it to 1,632. Failures add up to 88. The aggregate reported 1,631 requests, one fewer: a request that landed on the window edge between the two reads."
   },
   {
    "type": "text",
    "content": {
     "zh": "最近 7 天的每日失败率总体下降。统计窗口为 **{{md:-7}} {{hm}} 至 {{md:0}} {{hm}}**（UTC），按 UTC 自然日分组，因此首尾两天不是完整日。失败率＝失败请求数 ÷ 请求总数。",
     "en": "The daily failure rate fell over the last 7 days. The window runs from **{{md:-7}} {{hm}} to {{md:0}} {{hm}}** (UTC) and is grouped by UTC calendar day, so the first and last days are partial. Failure rate = failed requests ÷ total requests."
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "tool",
    "trace_id": "call_499c77b05be5059b7525de2356244694"
   },
   {
    "type": "thought",
    "content": "**Choosing the final totals**\n\nThe chart and the table are drawn from the SQL rows, so the summary should use the same figures: 1,632 requests and 88 failures, which is 88 ÷ 1,632 = 5.4%."
   },
   {
    "type": "text",
    "content": {
     "zh": "最近 7 天共 **1,632 次请求**，其中 **88 次失败**，整体失败率 **5.4%**。\n\n上方可切换查看每日请求数与失败率，并查阅精确数值。失败率总体下降；但首尾两天均为部分日，请求数不宜直接与完整日比较。",
     "en": "The last 7 days saw **1,632 requests**, **88 of them failed**, for an overall failure rate of **5.4%**.\n\nThe view above switches between daily requests and failure rate and lists the exact values. The failure rate fell throughout; the first and last days are partial, so their request counts should not be compared with a full day."
    }
   }
  ],
